--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

# FILES ADDED

1. src/main/ipc/windowIpc.ts
   - Purpose: window-minimize / window-maximize / window-close (honors the
     minimizeToTray setting) / window-quit / toggle-overlay channels.
2. src/main/ipc/sessionIpc.ts
   - Purpose: session-start / session-get / session-end with in-memory active
     session; persists a play session and recomputes achievements on end.
3. src/main/ipc/statsIpc.ts
   - Purpose: db-get-stats (per-game aggregates) and db-get-daily-stats (daily
     minutes/session counts for trend charts).
4. src/main/ipc/logsIpc.ts
   - Purpose: hash-log-file / verify-log-hash / read-log-tail / start-log-watch /
     stop-log-watch / db-get-log-hashes. All file access restricted to log paths
     registered in the game library.
5. src/main/ipc/aiIpc.ts
   - Purpose: ai-status / ai-ask / ai-daily-report / ai-daily-reports-batch /
     db-get-ai-reports / db-save-ai-report. Reports needsSetup instead of hanging
     when the AI server is absent or unconfigured.
6. src/main/services/aiHealth.ts
   - Purpose: electron-free probe of the local AI server /health endpoint
     (timeout-bounded, unit-testable under plain Node).
7. src/main/services/SystemStatsService.ts
   - Purpose: system stats (CPU %, RAM, ping, GPU, uptime) for the overlay HUD.
8. src/main/windowRegistry.ts
   - Purpose: trusted-window registry; getMainWindow, isTrustedSender,
     toggleOverlay, sendToOverlay. Sender validation for all Phase 2 handlers.
