# NEXT RECOMMENDED PHASE

Phase 3: AI Coach credential store + authenticated token bridge.

Rationale (based strictly on the actual state): the AI IPC surface is fully
wired and never hangs, but ai-ask / ai-daily-report / ai-daily-reports-batch
intentionally stop at "token bridge is not initialized yet". The next phase
should implement the encrypted credential store (keytar-backed, migrated out of
the legacy JSON store) and the callAiServerSafely token bridge so the AI coach
can actually produce reports — and, while touching the IPC layer, apply
isTrustedSender to the remaining legacy handlers listed under REMAINING ISSUES.
